                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'>Distribution Type</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff'> Filter for either Mutually Exclusive or Non Mutually Exclusive Non-Seamless Ratios. </run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'>Mutually Exclusive: </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff'>Session is Non-Seamless due to a single particular reason like only </run>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff'>Content Issue</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff'> or only </run>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff'>Technical Issue</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff'> etc.</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'>Non-Mutually Exclusive: </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff'>Session is Non-Seamless due to a multiple reasons like </run>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Roboto Mono' fontsize='7'>Content </run>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff'>Issue</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff'> and </run>
